      "paragraphs": [
        "Marchand helped Florida score 61 seconds into the game, then assisted on Eetu Luostarinen’s goal at 9:58 of the third to restore a 3–2 lead. This puck is from Luostarinen’s goal. Florida won 4–3 on Carter Verhaeghe’s goal with 26 seconds left; Marchand finished with two assists against his former team."
